& [ExecutionFrame] preserves the user's direct runtime concept
  + the user asks whether the executable can be assigned "a frame having a stack and a set of variables"
  + the user asks that "the stack and variables tracked follow a trajectory like an executable program"
  + the user asks for "subroutines and a main"

& [ChunkedInference] preserves the continuation mechanism
  + "if a current job requires more attention than the current frame provides then that means we hash our current frame and create a re-entry to take the next step"
  + "then we can chunk the inference job"
  + this source selects resumable bounded execution state before adding new call-stack or subroutine semantics

& [AttentionShell] preserves the interactive purpose
  + the user asks whether llama.cpp could build attention constraints "as a shell layer within attention"
  + the user imagines this "like some kind of IDE"
  + a later host may show an exact checkpoint to a model and request another bounded slice but no model call belongs inside the pure checkpoint runtime

& [ExistingFoundation] records what the repository already implements
  + ProcessInstanceState already contains definition region instruction index typed local state logical time lifecycle awaited condition message frontiers and remaining budgets
  + SerializedContinuation already hashes yielded or waiting process state without native stack capture
  + the CPPE coordinator already interprets two bounded process definitions with bind inspect compare branch select map emit receive yield wait reactivate join return and fault
  + the current public coordinator runs from genesis to a terminal or budget outcome in one host call and cannot resume the whole scheduler state from an intermediate checkpoint

& [SelectedGap] is exact whole-coordinator reentry
  + preserve all runtime products needed to choose the next deterministic scheduler transition
  + bind the checkpoint to exact catalogue procedure IR admission request and initial negotiation-session inputs
  + advance at most a caller-declared positive number of process or scheduler steps
  + return either a new digest-bound checkpoint or the same terminal outcome as uninterrupted execution
  + reject tampered stale cross-invocation or mismatched checkpoints without partial advancement

& [AuthorityBoundary] is dictated_source_only
  + this source authorizes SJS analysis of a pure resumable coordination checkpoint as the next prototype slice
  + canonical forms transition semantics compatibility tests and code require processed authority
  + no call-stack instruction subroutine grammar recursion model call prompt injection persistence network host registration external effect or claim of neural hidden-state continuation is authorized
